      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the veterinarians and clinical assistants for their gentle demeanour, attentiveness, and informative consultations. Visitors highlight patient explanations and compassionate care during stressful visits. A few reviewers reported administrative friction, but general impressions remain largely favourable."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
