      "title": {
        "en": "Rapid same-day and weekend access"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the clinic's ability to accommodate immediate same-day bookings and weekend urgent cases on short notice. Being open on Sundays and bank holidays gives pet owners immense peace of mind, with reviewers appreciating minimal lobby waiting times when urgent medical attention is required."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and reassuring pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how gently clinical teams handle both dogs and cats during urgent examinations. Staff take time to settle nervous puppies and fearful rescues, with visitors highlighting thoughtful treats and calming techniques that ease stress for companion animals during their visits."
      }
    }
  ],
